!theme plain
|a_default| Default
|a_default|
start
:To start the process, begin by checking if the order has been received.;
:v_tier: order amount tier ({<500, >2000, 1000-1500, 500-999}); <<objectSignal>>
switch ()
case ([v_tier = '<500'])
:If the sum of the order is less than 500;
:then continue with the process.;
case ([v_tier = '>2000'])
:if the sum of the order is greater than 2000;
:compute a discount of 4%.;
case ([v_tier = '1000-1500'])
:If the sum of the order falls between 1000 and 1500;
:compute a discount of 3%.;
case ([v_tier = '500-999'])
:if the sum of the order falls between 500 and 999;
:compute a discount of 2%.;
endswitch
:After checking the sum of the order, if it is still less than 500, continue with the process.;
:If the sum of the order is greater than 2000;
:Once again, check the sum of the order.;
:If it is less than 500, continue with the process.;
:Finally, create the bill and the process will come to an end.;
stop
